                "entry_id": "76f0dbd0-7ec1-3db4-b903-ba5adfa5c9a8",
                "word": "histogramme",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c51e57e9-b620-406e-a5f8-896b8aabbe01",
                        "entry_id": "76f0dbd0-7ec1-3db4-b903-ba5adfa5c9a8",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "histogrammes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "41010439-5ad7-3976-b5f3-9153216f23c9",
                        "entry_id": "76f0dbd0-7ec1-3db4-b903-ba5adfa5c9a8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Diagramme représentant une série de fréquences statistiques d’un phénomène donné par des rectangles juxtaposés à base constante et dont la hauteur est proportionnelle à la quantité exprimée."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b51f790-c4d4-45f5-a30f-4776697ca2a6",
                                "sense_id": "41010439-5ad7-3976-b5f3-9153216f23c9",
                                "text": "Le résultat sur chaque histogramme se lit comme le différentiel de croissance annuelle des quantités vendues par marché, en points de pourcentage."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c282e4a9-bfc2-4c01-86a3-8e66a21aaf35",
                        "source_entry_id": "76f0dbd0-7ec1-3db4-b903-ba5adfa5c9a8",
                        "source_sense_id": "41010439-5ad7-3976-b5f3-9153216f23c9",
                        "target_lang_word": "Histogramm",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Histogramm",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8b575205-789b-3493-8b64-5c018467854b",
                                        "entry_id": "825c021a-0606-3b2f-b4a0-3e7671c5157f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Grafik mit (nicht notwendigerweise gleich breiten) Säulen, deren Flächeninhalte Häufigkeiten oder Wahrscheinlichkeiten angeben"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81a35941-840d-491d-bb1e-5ac8243e3494",
                                                "sense_id": "8b575205-789b-3493-8b64-5c018467854b",
                                                "text": "„Bei einem Histogramm werden Rechtecke über die Klassenintervalle [αₖ,;αₖ₊₁,] errichtet. Die Fläche eines Rechtecks stellt die rel. Häufigkeit der jeweiligen klassifizierten Merkmalsausprägung dar. Aufgrund verschieden großer Intervalle kann die Rechteckbreite variieren. Die Höhe muss dementsprechend angepasst werden.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2e93386-a545-490f-a8a9-0425c755fd0f",
                                                "sense_id": "8b575205-789b-3493-8b64-5c018467854b",
                                                "text": "„In einem Histogramm werden die Häufigkeiten im Prinzip durch den Flächeninhalt der einzelnen Säulen bestimmt.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1da777bd-1093-4f36-8ab4-5ea7a7b6251d",
                        "source_entry_id": "76f0dbd0-7ec1-3db4-b903-ba5adfa5c9a8",
                        "source_sense_id": "41010439-5ad7-3976-b5f3-9153216f23c9",
                        "target_lang_word": "histogram",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "histogram",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "db5bcd07-2ac4-3475-9728-77531d15ae18",
                                        "entry_id": "f13cb117-3a8c-3d1b-8e40-6bb2aacdab0d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A graphical display of numerical data in the form of upright bars, with the area of each bar representing frequency."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5601f431-1504-4fd1-b3ac-635f316badd3",
                                                "sense_id": "db5bcd07-2ac4-3475-9728-77531d15ae18",
                                                "text": "Such distinctions, however, require detailed information, such as histograms of the distribution of energy use among residential customers, both by month and by year."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "865d0495-ea7b-4fbb-8fa3-b10821b50a07",
                                                "sense_id": "db5bcd07-2ac4-3475-9728-77531d15ae18",
                                                "text": "The use of the piecewise linear frequency polygon (FP) in place of the underlying histogram would seem mainly a graphical advantage."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8ca5112-8431-4215-a3d6-5c94df81f6e8",
                                                "sense_id": "db5bcd07-2ac4-3475-9728-77531d15ae18",
                                                "text": "A histogram is constructed by placing the variable of interest on the horizontal axis and the frequency, relative frequency or percent frequency on the vertical axis.[…]Histograms for data found in applications are never perfectly symmetric, but the histogram for many applications may be roughly symmetric."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "histogram",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "90d1e9d8-717f-3585-bde7-19769aba6240",
                                        "entry_id": "c5be7aa3-6623-3baa-ab43-db48cf715e5b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To represent (data) as a histogram."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
